# RazorNotes — Project Overview

**Godot 4.6 GDScript** mobile notes client that talks to a custom HTTP API backend.

- **App name:** RazorNotes
- **Engine:** Godot 4.6, Mobile renderer, portrait orientation (500×800)
- **Target platform:** Android (APK via `export_presets.cfg`)
- **Entry scene:** `res://menus/account_select/account_select.tscn`
- **Language:** GDScript only — no C#, no addons, no `src/` in another language

## Running

```
godot4 --path /path/to/razor-app        # editor/desktop run
```

No `Makefile`, `npm`, or other build tools. No automated test suite — testing requires a running Godot editor or a device.

## Sync modes

Each account has a `sync_mode` field with one of three values:

| Value | Meaning |
|---|---|
| `remote_only` | Never cache; always fetch from server |
| `local_some` | Cache individual notes on demand |
| `full_mirror` | Full hash-diff sync; auto-syncs on app focus (every 180 s) |
